.SH RETURN VALUE
These functions return
.B OK
on success and
.B ERR
on failure.
.PP
In
.IR \%ncurses ","
they return
.B ERR
if
.I win
is
.IR NULL "."
.PP
.B \%wcolor_set
returns
.B ERR
if
.I pair
is outside the range
.BR 0 .\|. COLOR_PAIRS\-1 .
.PP
.B \%wattr_get
does
.I not
fail if its
.I \%attrs
or
.I \%pair
parameter is
.IR NULL "."
.PP
Functions prefixed with \*(``mv\*('' first perform cursor movement and
fail if the position
.RI ( y ,
.IR x )
is outside the window boundaries.
.\" ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
